{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"获取长周期订单数据，可根据指定的客户ID、数据主题、维度、指标、过滤条件、时间范围等进行查询。可配合【获取Access token】接口获取授权access_token，以及【长周期订单可用维度和指标】接口获取不同数据主题下的可用维度和指标。\",\"id\":\"qianchuan.long_transfer_order.get\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/report/long_transfer/order/data/get/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"1807348907403268\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"qianchuan.access_token.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"qianchuan.long_transfer_order.dimension_metric.get\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1807348855527500\",\"reason\":\"可通过此接口获取不同数据主题下的可用维度和指标，用于本接口的查询\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"长周期订单可用维度和指标\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"1807348907403268\",\"title\":\"获取长周期订单数据\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-8DBnNYp3\">获取长周期订单</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201804643211232284%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201748264006369288%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-5oIJjoA4\" id=\"h346b9f0-5oIJjoA4\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-TsHYC4Ue\"><a href=\"https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/report/long_transfer/order/data/get/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v1.0/qianchuan/report/long_transfer/order/data/get/</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1807348907403268\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1777555692984388\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-EJk0Yps4\" id=\"h346b9f0-EJk0Yps4\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-OzjEjN4s\">GET</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-DgZ3FNgg\" id=\"h346b9f0-DgZ3FNgg\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-GZ5q1f5j\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-1Ip83LWD\" id=\"h346b9f0-1Ip83LWD\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">advertiser_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JUGdMRSS\">客户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">data_topic</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-WAZ1DGPB\">数据主题：枚举值</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Bq5PfcFo\"><code>LONG_TRANSFER_ORDER</code>长周期转化价值-订单明细</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">dimensions</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-0cI2oIIL\">维度列表。\n可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1807348855527500\" target=\"_blank\">【长周期订单可用维度和指标】</a>接口获取不同数据主题下的可用维度和指标</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-P99pTtTK\">注意：<span style=\"color: #3ab54a;\"><strong>lower_search、</strong></span><span style=\"color: #52c41a;\"><strong>attribute_time_type、marketing_goal非维度字段</strong></span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">metrics</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-TQNVlaOc\">指标列表 。\n可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1807348855527500\" target=\"_blank\">【长周期订单可用维度和指标】</a>接口获取不同数据主题下的可用维度和指标</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">filters</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Vd7VzDnP\">过滤条件。\n可通过<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1807348855527500\" target=\"_blank\">【长周期订单可用维度和指标】</a>接口获取不同数据主题下的可用维度和指标</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-sUwYlsnN\">注意：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-FreB1CEG\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-VlL9Ta1a\"><span style=\"color: #3ab54a;\"><strong>external_action_fork，不支持筛选和排序</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YR0bbc47\"><span style=\"color: #3ab54a;\"><strong>ad_name，不支持筛选</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-dWw03RdI\"><span style=\"color: #3ab54a;\"><strong>lower_search为过滤字段，非维度字段，仅支持ad_id过滤</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Dm6AYIlH\"><span style=\"color: #52c41a;\"><strong>attribute_time_type为过滤字段，非维度字段</strong></span></li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-UZjh5ZQ5\"><span style=\"color: #52c41a;\"><strong>marketing_goal为过滤字段，非维度字段</strong></span></li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">field</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-P8AWsmcl\">过滤的消耗指标字段</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">operator</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-zPUlRzGS\">处理方式。 允许值：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-KX3QfHZR\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Y2dJglFp\">7-包含</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">values</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-NJ6beNLe\">过滤字段具体值</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">start_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kYZAQOsN\">开始时间。格式为：yyyy-MM-dd。例如2022-08-01</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">end_time</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-XeoSZGHL\">结束时间。格式为：yyyy-MM-dd。例如2022-08-01（默认为当天23:59:59）</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"